 section('website','This portfolio','<p>This portfolio uses static pages, local assets and small scripts for mobile navigation and the awards gallery. It does not contain a contact form, advertising scripts or analytics added by the portfolio developer.</p><p>The hosting provider may process technical information such as IP addresses and server logs under its own policies. Professional enquiries can be made through the linked professional profiles, subject to those services’ own policies.</p>'),
